+#: applications/luci-app-ssr-plus/luasrc/model/cbi/shadowsocksr/servers.lua:591
+msgid "Mihomo Smart Grouping and Auto Select"
+msgstr "Mihomo 智能分组与自动选择"
+
+#: applications/luci-app-ssr-plus/luasrc/model/cbi/shadowsocksr/servers.lua:594
+msgid ""
+"Smart grouping for Mihomo/Clash: when the subscription YAML has no node "
+"groups of its own, nodes are grouped by the region found in their names "
+"(e.g. Hong Kong 01 / Hong Kong 02 -> China Hong Kong), and every region "
+"group automatically uses its fastest node. A global auto-select group over "
+"all nodes is added as well. All these group names are inserted into every "
+"route group, so a route group can pick a whole region at once. Custom groups "
+"can be created from the Group Manager button in the Clash panel. If a node "
+"was already selected manually before, press Reset Default Proxies Rules once "
+"so Mihomo falls back to the new default."
+msgstr ""
+"为 Mihomo/Clash 做智能分组：当订阅 YAML 本身没有节点分组时，按节点名里的地区自动"
+"归类（如 香港01/香港02 → 中国香港），每个地区组内部自动使用最快节点；同时生成一个"
+"覆盖全部节点的全局自动选择组。这些组名会被插入到每个分流组的节点选择里，分流组可以"
+"直接选「某个地区」。自定义分组可在 Clash 面板的「分组管理」里创建。若此前已手动选过"
+"节点，请点一次「重置默认代理规则」，Mihomo 才会回落到新的默认项。"
+
+#: applications/luci-app-ssr-plus/luasrc/model/cbi/shadowsocksr/servers.lua:596
+msgid "Region Auto Grouping"
+msgstr "地区自动分组"
+
+#: applications/luci-app-ssr-plus/luasrc/model/cbi/shadowsocksr/servers.lua:599
+msgid ""
+"Group nodes by region when the subscription provides no node groups of its "
+"own. Turn it off to keep only the global auto-select group."
+msgstr ""
+"订阅没有自带节点分组时，按地区自动归类。关闭后只保留全局自动选择组。"
+
+#: applications/luci-app-ssr-plus/luasrc/model/cbi/shadowsocksr/servers.lua:602
+msgid "Region Group Minimum Nodes"
+msgstr "地区分组最少节点数"
+
+#: applications/luci-app-ssr-plus/luasrc/model/cbi/shadowsocksr/servers.lua:605
+msgid ""
+"A region becomes its own group only when it has at least this many nodes "
+"(set 1 so single-node regions are grouped too)."
+msgstr ""
+"某地区至少有这么多节点时才单独成组（设为 1 则单节点地区也成组）。"
+
+#: applications/luci-app-ssr-plus/luasrc/model/cbi/shadowsocksr/servers.lua:608
+msgid "Region Group Maximum Count"
+msgstr "地区分组数量上限"
+
+#: applications/luci-app-ssr-plus/luasrc/model/cbi/shadowsocksr/servers.lua:611
+msgid ""
+"Upper limit of generated region groups; the regions with the most nodes are "
+"kept."
+msgstr ""
+"自动生成的地区分组数量上限，超出时保留节点最多的地区。"
+
+#: applications/luci-app-ssr-plus/luasrc/model/cbi/shadowsocksr/servers.lua:601
+msgid "URL-Test Address"
+msgstr "URL-Test 测速地址"
+
+#: applications/luci-app-ssr-plus/luasrc/model/cbi/shadowsocksr/servers.lua:607
+msgid "Leave empty to reuse the URL Test Address above."
+msgstr "留空则复用上方的「URL 测试地址」。"
+
+#: applications/luci-app-ssr-plus/luasrc/model/cbi/shadowsocksr/servers.lua:609
+msgid "URL-Test Interval"
+msgstr "URL-Test 测速间隔"
+
+#: applications/luci-app-ssr-plus/luasrc/model/cbi/shadowsocksr/servers.lua:612
+msgid "Seconds between two health checks (minimum 30)."
+msgstr "两次测速之间的间隔秒数（最小 30）。"
+
+#: applications/luci-app-ssr-plus/luasrc/model/cbi/shadowsocksr/servers.lua:616
+msgid "URL-Test Tolerance"
+msgstr "URL-Test 切换容差"
+
+#: applications/luci-app-ssr-plus/luasrc/model/cbi/shadowsocksr/servers.lua:619
+msgid "Switch only when a node is faster by more than this value (milliseconds)."
+msgstr "仅当某节点快出该值（毫秒）以上时才切换，避免频繁抖动。"
+
